  "adminDetails": "Admin Details",
  "gameDescription": "📜 COMBAT – BRIEF DESCRIPTION\n\nCombat is a competition of 1 – 4 drones within the DRONLAB (controlled outdoor area). Before each match the professor designs the scenario and places destructible obstacles, so the terrain changes every time.\n\nSCORING\n• 10 PTS for taking down another drone\n• 1 PT for destroying an obstacle\n\nALTITUDE\nDrones cannot exceed 5 m in height.\n\nRESPAWN\nIf the mode allows, a destroyed drone respawns after 10 sec and automatically ascends to 5 M. In the last drone standing mode there is no respawn.\n\nMODES\n• Last Drone Standing\n• Free-for-all with respawn\n• 2 vs 2 with respawn\n• Typical time limit: 8 MIN\n\nStrategy combines shooting, obstacle use, and fence placement to dominate the DRONLAB.",
  "gameManual": "📖 COMBAT – QUICK MANUAL\n\nOBJECTIVE\nAccumulate the highest score or be the last operational drone before time runs out.\n\nSETUP\n1. The professor configures the scenario and obstacles.\n2. Pilots wait in the lobby until the Game Started signal.\n\nCONTROLS (Two joysticks)\n• LEFT: YAW (X) AND ASCEND/DESCEND (Y)\n• RIGHT: HORIZONTAL MOVEMENT (X) AND FORWARD/BACKWARD (Y)\n\nWEAPONS\n| Projectile | Rate | Approx. Speed | Damage |\n|------------|------|---------------|--------|\n| Small      | 0.5 S| 800 M/S       | low    |\n| Medium     | 1 S  | 500 M/S       | medium |\n| Large      | 2 S  | 100 M/S       | high   |\n\nOBSTACLES\nDestructible; worth 1 PT when destroyed.\n\nRESPAWN\nIf enabled, you respawn after 10 sec at 5 m altitude.\n\nEND\nWhen time expires or only one drone remains, a results table shows eliminations, obstacles, and total points.",
